                  "value": "Pilot chart of the North Atlantic Ocean : January, 1895. Date of publication, January 2, 1895. Published monthly at the Hydrographic Office, Bureau of Navigation, Department of the Navy, Washington, D.C., Charles D. Sigsbee, Commander, U.S.N., Hydrographer."
